Lesson board («Урок на доске»)
================================================================================

The in-product collaborative lesson board is implemented by Lexora using
standard browser APIs (HTML Canvas 2D). It does not embed the Excalidraw
library or other third-party whiteboard UI components.

See also: frontend/public/third-party-notices.txt for notices shipped with the
web application.
